#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:5 8093351600fb40faa78c1601e33d6ba9
msgid "Sending Commands from rviz"
msgstr "从 rviz 发送命令"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:11 5c17dc5175424d278a5200bc701c1fc0
msgid ""
"`rviz <http://wiki.ros.org/rviz>`__ allows real-time viewing of the "
"vehicle's local position and attitude, lidar data and :ref:`cartographer's "
"3D map <ros-cartographer-slam>`.  It is also possible to set a local "
"position target and have ROS's navigation libraries (with help from "
"ArduPilot's velocity controller) move the vehicle to the target."
msgstr ""
"`rviz <http://wiki.ros.org/rviz>`__ 支持实时查看飞行器的本地位置和姿态、激光雷达数据及 "
":ref:`cartographer 的 3D 地图 <ros-cartographer-slam>`。还可设置本地位置目标，由 ROS 导航库（借助 "
"ArduPilot 速度控制器）将飞行器移动到目标位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:13 549771a60c224cc784b84b8874414665
msgid ""
"These instructions were tested on a :ref:`Nvidia TX2 <companion-computer-"
"nvidia-tx2>` running an :ref:`APSync image <apsync-intro>` with ROS "
"installed as described :ref:`here <ros-install>`.  Some of the information "
"on this page was found on these wiki pages:"
msgstr ""
"这些说明在运行 :ref:`APSync 镜像 <apsync-intro>` 的 :ref:`Nvidia TX2 <companion-"
"computer-nvidia-tx2>` 上测试，ROS 按 :ref:`此处 <ros-install>` 所述安装。本页部分信息来自以下 wiki"
" 页面："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:15 4cbe820d1f174d8987e7e59c9eee7cc6
msgid "`ros.org's NetworkSetup <http://wiki.ros.org/ROS/NetworkSetup>`__"
msgstr "`ros.org 的网络设置 <http://wiki.ros.org/ROS/NetworkSetup>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:16 a089ff397ddd4a968b3217e61f2b144e
msgid ""
"`answers.ros.org's \"How to run Rviz remotely\" "
"<https://answers.ros.org/question/10343/how-to-run-rviz-remotely/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`answers.ros.org 的「如何远程运行 Rviz」 <https://answers.ros.org/question/10343/how-"
"to-run-rviz-remotely/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:17 5b9af89626e44356ad22088e8a15dadb
msgid ""
"`answers.ros.org's \"rostopic list works but rostopic echo does not\" "
"<https://answers.ros.org/question/48240/rostopic-list-works-but-rostopic-"
"echo-does-not/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`answers.ros.org 的「rostopic list 有效但 rostopic echo 无效」 "
"<https://answers.ros.org/question/48240/rostopic-list-works-but-rostopic-"
"echo-does-not/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:20 8f03ff7ebfc64238affa6ff0d3158a53
msgid "Client PC Setup"
msgstr "客户端电脑设置"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:22 2fcf4ea98f1e4ae6a621f8841c31fa5d
msgid "Install ROS \"Desktop-Full\" on the client side PC (where rviz will run)."
msgstr "在客户端电脑（rviz 运行的机器）上安装 ROS「Desktop-Full」。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:23 ccbd61e23eff475ca82aa14195a608bf
msgid ""
"Connect to the vehicle's wifi access point (if using APSync the default "
"username/password is ardupilot/ardupilot)"
msgstr "连接飞行器的 WiFi 接入点（若使用 APSync，默认用户名/密码为 ardupilot/ardupilot）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:24 baab0fc2a2b04a9eba027c02f302a51c
msgid ""
"Open a command prompt and check that that you can \"ping\" the companion "
"computer running ROS.  If using APSync, both of these commands should work"
msgstr "打开命令提示符，确认可以「ping」通运行 ROS 的伴飞计算机。若使用 APSync，以下两条命令应均可用"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:31 7a29dff6201344acb1cc137aa1f957a0
msgid ""
"Using your favourite editor, open the ``/etc/hosts`` file (may require using"
" sudo) and ensure the companion computer appears in the list.  Below is what"
" should appear if the companion computer is running APSync"
msgstr ""
"使用您喜欢的编辑器打开 ``/etc/hosts`` 文件（可能需要 sudo），确认伴飞计算机出现在列表中。以下是伴飞计算机运行 APSync "
"时应出现的内容"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:38 5fba892951834e639942e0c7ec91d306
msgid ""
"In a new command prompt, type ``hostname`` to get the name of the client PC"
msgstr "在新命令提示符中，输入 ``hostname`` 获取客户端电脑名称"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:39 63bf87d0fe4c46999d220fa0b3372830
msgid ""
"Using your favourite editor add the following two lines to the bottom of "
"``~/.bashrc``"
msgstr "使用您喜欢的编辑器将以下两行添加到 ``~/.bashrc`` 末尾"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:47 cc5862ea906a4bbd8c5c8cab834c7f92
msgid "Companion Computer Setup"
msgstr "伴飞计算机设置"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:49 b37ec2949baa41a0a7e6ae069ae6ac00
msgid ""
"ssh onto the companion computer.  If using APsync the following should work "
"(password is \"apsync\")"
msgstr "SSH 连接到伴飞计算机。若使用 APsync，以下命令应可用（密码为「apsync」）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:55 0ab7cc3347094ca887ae4d3a85343218
msgid ""
"With your favourite editor add the following lines to the bottom of "
"``~/.bashrc``"
msgstr "使用您喜欢的编辑器将以下内容添加到 ``~/.bashrc`` 末尾"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:63 255651ebcfc749d497b0f109a9c17cc9
msgid "Check ROS data is available on the Client"
msgstr "确认客户端可获取 ROS 数据"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:65 0c9ef5bcee1248439b6baab4166bbe3e
msgid ""
"To confirm the client laptop can retrieve data from the vehicle try the "
"following commands"
msgstr "为确认客户端笔记本可从飞行器获取数据，请尝试以下命令"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:73 eb94d573162f441185b2fb056fa33d9d
msgid "Start rviz"
msgstr "启动 rviz"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:75 62e9dc22522b48f49e2d6d1555165180
msgid "On the client PC start rviz"
msgstr "在客户端电脑上启动 rviz"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:81 a78200db78bd410ba5d9c446a96c50f1
msgid "To see a real-time Lidar data"
msgstr "查看实时激光雷达数据"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:83 02d54cc879004e6ea542d8a1b0826b20
msgid "In the Display area, select \"Add\", \"LaserScan\""
msgstr "在显示区域，选择「Add」（添加），「LaserScan」（激光扫描）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:84 59773758834e49d8bfe7458357b52107
msgid "once added, expand the \"LaserScan\" section and set \"Topic\" to \"/scan\""
msgstr "添加后，展开「LaserScan」部分，将「Topic」设置为「/scan」"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:86 f5ced462724046c489e362bb0057abf5
msgid "To see a map of the environment"
msgstr "查看环境地图"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:88 9e02a25d7c734dc9a3c496d2ba31ba42
msgid "select \"Add\", \"Map\""
msgstr "选择「Add」（添加），「Map」（地图）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:89 a5b9d39478a245c2bdc8fdfead442283
msgid "once added, expand the \"Map\" section and set the \"Topic\" to \"/map\""
msgstr "添加后，展开「Map」部分，将「Topic」设置为「/map」"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:91 ddd47de08a56471bb31f6e6cbf32e009
msgid "To see the vehicle's current heading (according to ROS)"
msgstr "查看飞行器当前航向（按 ROS 数据）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:93 f6ba98c98c3849ca840ca1bac3aaef37
msgid "select \"Add\", \"Pose\""
msgstr "选择「Add」（添加），「Pose」（位姿）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:94 2012707309424d3c8ccd885767c4eb1a
msgid "once added, expand the \"Pose\" section and set the \"Topic\" to \"/robot_pose\""
msgstr "添加后，展开「Pose」部分，将「Topic」设置为「/robot_pose」"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:97 0ad4ae5a989040a090adc399487c44d4
msgid "Sending Position Targets"
msgstr "发送位置目标"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:99 234d6fc01d2a42c89c910f0527183258
msgid ""
"To allow ROS to send position targets to ArduPilot via mavros, log onto the "
"Companion Computer running ROS and modify mavros's node.launch file with "
"your favourite editor (like gedit shown below)"
msgstr ""
"为允许 ROS 通过 mavros 向 ArduPilot 发送位置目标，登录运行 ROS 的伴飞计算机，使用您喜欢的编辑器（如下面所示的 "
"gedit）修改 mavros 的 node.launch 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:107 1b2e3af6678a4c3a816e470847aab0e0
msgid ""
"After ``<rosparam command=\"load\" file=\"$(arg config_yaml)\" />`` add a "
"line like below and restart the all ROS processes"
msgstr ""
"在 ``<rosparam command=\"load\" file=\"$(arg config_yaml)\" />`` "
"之后添加如下内容，然后重启所有 ROS 进程"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:113 085afab2ce4c40718d445bf636677c5b
msgid "Arm the vehicle and switch to Guided mode"
msgstr "解锁飞行器并切换到引导模式"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:114 12a7ea3e2c11447ea5493d0abbaeec2b
msgid ""
"From within rviz, click the \"2D Nav Goal\" button and then click and hold "
"the mouse button on the map to aim the green arrow (this sets the target "
"position and final attitude) and then release the mouse button"
msgstr ""
"在 rviz 中，点击「2D Nav Goal」按钮，然后在地图上按住鼠标按钮以瞄准绿色箭头方向（设置目标位置和最终姿态），然后松开鼠标按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:115 b15f0a0781b04e3a9bd73ae7534656a7
msgid ""
"The ground station should show the target position that the vehicle is "
"moving towards (Mission Planner drops a green marker at the target position "
"and draws an orange line towards the target from the vehicle)"
msgstr "地面站应显示飞行器正在移动的目标位置（Mission Planner 在目标位置放置绿色标记，并从飞行器到目标绘制一条橙色线）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:117 06b33fee77d84ab8a4be2f7efb6710ee
msgid ""
"If everything does not go as expected the following commands may help "
"diagnose the issue"
msgstr "若结果不符合预期，以下命令可能有助于诊断问题"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:119 017a9c0d6aa54ced8657e1bfdeee6c94
msgid ""
"``rostopic info /move_base_simple/goal`` should show Publishers as \"rviz\" "
"and Subscribers as \"mavros\""
msgstr "``rostopic info /move_base_simple/goal`` 应显示发布者为「rviz」，订阅者为「mavros」"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:120 2ca040aba6e7411abc93ed1255a84f9f
msgid ""
"``rostopic echo /move_base_simple/goal`` should display a \"position\" and "
"\"orientation\" the moment after the \"2D NavGoal\" has been set"
msgstr ""
"``rostopic echo /move_base_simple/goal`` 应在设置「2D "
"NavGoal」后立即显示「position」和「orientation」"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-rviz.rst:121 224e43d020b04e208dd7707d17757775
msgid ""
"``rosrun rqt_graph rqt_graph`` shows a graphical diagram of ROS's nodes and "
"their connections"
msgstr "``rosrun rqt_graph rqt_graph`` 显示 ROS 节点及其连接的图形示意图"
